    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Protocol 02</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Utilize corrugated fiberboard sheets to wrap larger wooden furniture and appliances. These rigid boards protect against scratches, dents, and scuffs on painted or polished surfaces. By folding the edges tightly and securing them with tape, movers create a structural shield that maintains the shape of bulky items while adding an extra layer of defense against minor collisions.</p>
